CL: [New] Added Ministation to the map rotation.

Without the return in the decorator the effect is that after

  @app.route('/')
  class MyView(LonaView):
    ...

the name `MyView` is bound to `None`, because the decorator syntax is just
a nice way to write:

  class MyView(LonaView):
    ...
  MyView = app.route('/')(MyView)

With the return added, `MyView` holds the class as expected.
